        "answer": {
          "short": "$12x(2x^2+5)^2$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d}{dx}(2x^2+5)^3&=3(2x^2+5)^2(4x)\\\\&=12x(2x^2+5)^2\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
