        "answer": {
          "short": "$(2x^2+5)^3+C$",
          "worked": "From part a, $\\dfrac{d}{dx}(2x^2+5)^3=12x(2x^2+5)^2$.\n$$\\int12x(2x^2+5)^2\\,dx=(2x^2+5)^3+C$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      },
      {
